{"id":"f4ee50f99db72eec","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-turing-degree.md","title":"Turing Degree","display":"df-turing-degree — Turing Degree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-turing-degree","aliases":["88-df-turing-degree"],"display":"df-turing-degree — Turing Degree","depends_on":["[[88-df-turing-degree-def]]","[[88-df-turing-reduction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-turing-degree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-turing-degree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-degree — Turing Degree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1d37344e2980aa69\" href=\"?note=1d37344e2980aa69\" title=\"88-df-turing-degree-def\">88-df-turing-degree-def</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ceb241b03d936136\" href=\"?note=ceb241b03d936136\" title=\"88-df-turing-reduction\">88-df-turing-reduction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (natural-number sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_T\">\\(\\leq_T\\)</span> (Turing reducible, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ceb241b03d936136\" href=\"?note=ceb241b03d936136\" title=\"88-df-turing-reduction\">88-df-turing-reduction</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\deg_T\">\\(\\deg_T\\)</span> (Turing-degree operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1d37344e2980aa69\" href=\"?note=1d37344e2980aa69\" title=\"88-df-turing-degree-def\">88-df-turing-degree-def</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_T\">\\(\\mathcal D_T\\)</span> (class of Turing degrees)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D_T\">\\(\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D_T\\)</span> (Turing degrees)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_T\">\\(\\preceq_T\\)</span> (degree ordering)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree} \\vdash\n\\mathcal D_T\\coloneqq\\{\\deg_T(A):A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree} \\vdash\n\\mathcal D_T\\coloneqq\\{\\deg_T(A):A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree} \\vdash\n\\mathbf a\\preceq_T\\mathbf b\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D_T\n\\land\\exists A\\in\\mathbf a\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathbf b\\;(A\\leq_TB)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree} \\vdash\n\\mathbf a\\preceq_T\\mathbf b\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D_T\n\\land\\exists A\\in\\mathbf a\\;\\exists B\\in\\mathbf b\\;(A\\leq_TB)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree} \\vdash\n\\mathbf 0\\coloneqq\\deg_T(\\emptyset)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree} \\vdash\n\\mathbf 0\\coloneqq\\deg_T(\\emptyset)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\deg_T(A)\">\\(\\deg_T(A)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>的Turing度</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_T\">\\(\\leq_T\\)</span> : Turing可归约关系</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_T\">\\(\\equiv_T\\)</span> : Turing等价关系</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_T\">\\(\\mathcal D_T\\)</span> : 所有 Turing 度组成的类</li>\n<li>代表元的选择不影响 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_T\">\\(\\preceq_T\\)</span>；其偏序性质由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fa9532db07327ff3\" href=\"?note=fa9532db07327ff3\" title=\"88-lem-degree-partial-order\">88-lem-degree-partial-order</a> 给出。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-turing-degree-def","status":"resolved","id":"1d37344e2980aa69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-turing-degree-def]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"ceb241b03d936136","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-turing-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"ceb241b03d936136","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\leq_T$ (Turing reducible, see [[88-df-turing-reduction]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-turing-degree-def","status":"resolved","id":"1d37344e2980aa69","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\deg_T$ (Turing-degree operator, see [[88-df-turing-degree-def]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-lem-degree-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"fa9532db07327ff3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"代表元的选择不影响 $\\preceq_T$；其偏序性质由 [[88-lem-degree-partial-order]] 给